    "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"tr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>6. Sınıf 1. Ünite Özeti</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Patrick+Hand&family=Roboto:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            font-size: 16px; /* Base font size for scaling */\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #374151;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .handwritten {\n            font-family: 'Patrick Hand', cursive;\n        }\n        .board-card {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            background-image: linear-gradient(#e5e7eb 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 100% 2rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            line-height: 2rem;\n        }\n        .marker-highlight {\n            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fde68a 0%, #fde68a 100%);\n            background-repeat: no-repeat;\n            background-size: 100% 40%;\n            background-position: 0 80%;\n        }\n        /* Custom Scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 12px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #f1f1f1;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #cbd5e1;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: #94a3b8;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-screen flex flex-col p-4\">\n\n    <!-- Control Bar -->\n    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4 bg-gray-800 p-3 rounded-2xl shadow-lg\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold ml-4\">\n            <span class=\"text-yellow-400\">1. ÜNİTE:</span> Kur'an'ı Tanıyalım\n        </h1>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n            <button onclick=\"changeFontSize(-1)\" class=\"bg-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-lg font-bold transition shadow\" title=\"Yazıyı Küçült\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i> A\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"changeFontSize(1)\" class=\"bg-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-lg font-bold transition shadow\" title=\"Yazıyı Büyüt\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> A\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"toggleFullScreen()\" class=\"bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-xl text-lg font-bold transition shadow\" title=\"Tam Ekran\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Tam Ekran\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- CONTENT AREA -->\n    <div class=\"flex-grow relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden\">\n        \n        <div class=\"board-card h-full w-full rounded-3xl p-8 overflow-y-auto border-t-8 border-yellow-400 relative\">\n            <!-- Pin Icon -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 text-red-500 text-5xl opacity-80\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-thumbtack\"></i>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-8\">\n                <!-- Sol Sütun: Temel Bilgiler -->\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-yellow-300\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-indigo-200 inline-block pb-1\">1. Temel Kavramlar</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"text-2xl space-y-4 handwritten text-gray-800\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-star text-yellow-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span><strong>Ayet:</strong> Kur'an'ın her bir cümlesidir. Duraklarla ayrılır.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-book-open text-orange-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span><strong>Sure:</strong> Ayetlerden oluşan bölümdür (114 tane).</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-layer-group text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span><strong>Cüz:</strong> 20 sayfalık bölümdür (30 tane).</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-bookmark text-blue-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span><strong>Hizip:</strong> Cüzün her 5 sayfalık bölümüdür.</span></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-gray-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Son ilahi kitaptır, Hz. Muhammed'e (sav) indirilmiştir.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Sağ Sütun: Harfler ve Dualar -->\n                <div class=\"bg-rose-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-rose-300\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-rose-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-rose-200 inline-block pb-1\">2. Okuma Kuralları</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"text-2xl space-y-6 handwritten text-gray-800\">\n                        <li>\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-language mr-2 text-purple-500\"></i>Peltek Harfler:</div>\n                            <p class=\"mb-2 text-xl italic\">Dil ucu dişlere değer.</p>\n                            <ul class=\"ml-8 list-disc marker:text-purple-500\">\n                                <li><strong>Peltek Se (ث)</strong></li>\n                                <li><strong>Peltek Zel (ذ)</strong></li>\n                                <li><strong>Peltek Za (ظ)</strong> - (Kalın okunur)</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"border-t border-rose-200 pt-4\">\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-praying mr-2 text-green-600\"></i>Salli ve Barik Duaları:</div>\n                            <ul class=\"ml-8 list-disc marker:text-green-600\">\n                                <li>Namazların son oturuşunda okunur.</li>\n                                <li>Peygamberimize ve ailesine <strong>dua ve selam</strong> edilir.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let currentFontSize = 16; // Default root font size in px\n\n        function changeFontSize(amount) {\n            currentFontSize += amount;\n            if (currentFontSize < 12) currentFontSize = 12; // Min limit\n            if (currentFontSize > 28) currentFontSize = 28; // Max limit\n            document.documentElement.style.fontSize = currentFontSize + 'px';\n        }\n\n        function toggleFullScreen() {\n            if (!document.fullscreenElement) {\n                document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();\n            } else {\n                if (document.exitFullscreen) {\n                    document.exitFullscreen();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
